// --- Radar aspect correction (added) : X x0.75 so the minimap disc stays round in 16:9
// CRadar screen rect in 640x448 HUD space:  x = 87 +- 94/2 ,  y = 382 -+ 76/2
//   -> patched to                          x = 65 +- 70.5/2 (= 4:3-identical physical size/margin)
// Y constants (382 / 76) are intentionally left untouched.
